    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bike Stunt 3D Freestyle - Unleash Your Inner Daredevil!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to ignite your adrenaline with <strong>Bike Stunt 3D Freestyle</strong>! This thrilling side-scrolling stunt game challenges you to push the limits of gravity and skill as you master a variety of epic tricks and stunts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476990/extras/a4e7755e71cfa99d0565511aebbada8a.poster.avif?t=1737349213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476990/extras/a4e7755e71cfa99d0565511aebbada8a.webm?t=1737349213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476990/extras/a4e7755e71cfa99d0565511aebbada8a.mp4?t=1737349213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daring Stunt Challenges: </strong>Test your biking prowess across a series of increasingly complex courses. From daring flips to gravity-defying tricks, every stunt counts toward your high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments:</strong> Experience vibrant, detailed graphics as you navigate through diverse and challenging environments. Each level offers a new backdrop to showcase your stunt skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Characters:</strong> Personalize your rider with a wide array of customization options. Choose unique outfits and gear to make your character stand out in every performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Distinct Bikes:\u00a0</strong>Select from four unique bikes, each with its own characteristics and performance traits. Choose the one that fits your style and enhance your gameplay experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive Controls:</strong> Whether you\u2019re a seasoned rider or a newcomer, the game\u2019s controls are designed for ease of use and depth. Perfect your timing and execution to land those impressive tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Unlocks: </strong>As you conquer levels and earn high scores, unlock new customization options and enhance your riding experience. Compete for top spots on the leaderboards and showcase your skills to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the world of <strong>Bike Stunt 3D Freestyle</strong> and unleash your inner stunt rider. Download now and start your journey to become the ultimate bike stunt champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to take on the challenge? </strong>Gear up and ride to fame with <strong>Bike Stunt 3D Freestyle</strong>!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bike Stunt 3D Freestyle - Unleash Your Inner Daredevil!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to ignite your adrenaline with <strong>Bike Stunt 3D Freestyle</strong>! This thrilling side-scrolling stunt game challenges you to push the limits of gravity and skill as you master a variety of epic tricks and stunts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476990/extras/a4e7755e71cfa99d0565511aebbada8a.poster.avif?t=1737349213\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476990/extras/a4e7755e71cfa99d0565511aebbada8a.webm?t=1737349213\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476990/extras/a4e7755e71cfa99d0565511aebbada8a.mp4?t=1737349213\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Daring Stunt Challenges: </strong>Test your biking prowess across a series of increasingly complex courses. From daring flips to gravity-defying tricks, every stunt counts toward your high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments:</strong> Experience vibrant, detailed graphics as you navigate through diverse and challenging environments. Each level offers a new backdrop to showcase your stunt skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Characters:</strong> Personalize your rider with a wide array of customization options. Choose unique outfits and gear to make your character stand out in every performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Distinct Bikes:\u00a0</strong>Select from four unique bikes, each with its own characteristics and performance traits. Choose the one that fits your style and enhance your gameplay experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive Controls:</strong> Whether you\u2019re a seasoned rider or a newcomer, the game\u2019s controls are designed for ease of use and depth. Perfect your timing and execution to land those impressive tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Unlocks: </strong>As you conquer levels and earn high scores, unlock new customization options and enhance your riding experience. Compete for top spots on the leaderboards and showcase your skills to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the world of <strong>Bike Stunt 3D Freestyle</strong> and unleash your inner stunt rider. Download now and start your journey to become the ultimate bike stunt champion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ready to take on the challenge? </strong>Gear up and ride to fame with <strong>Bike Stunt 3D Freestyle</strong>!</p>",
